> How does one get these wonderful +8 enchantment weapons? 
 
The way you think - you wield it and read a scroll of enchant weapon.
Some tips may help though: an uncursed scroll gives you +1, whereas a
blessed one gives you +1 to +3. And (and this is pretty important...)
if your weapon is at better than +5, it may vanish if you read another
scroll. So the trick is to get the weapon at +5 and then read a
blessed scroll and hope for a +3 enchantment. (BTW, is this purely
dependent on random or is your luck or stats involved?)

